  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Me and my friends seems to have a weird issue where we get connection timed out a lot and voices are cutting in and out, but only in European instances. We all live decently close in the Trøndelag region in Norway, so there might be an issue with the ISP? How should we go forward with troubleshooting/fixing this issue?\n\nI spent about 10 minutes to just get into my homeworld (set to a European instance) because of connection timed out and also got that in other European instances I joined. I then remembered we had this issue last weekend to and hopped over to an American instance and then it worked perfectly for hours. I have tried the normal version, open beta and Steam audio beta.\n\nHere is a video of the issue:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/-Iu54n1egNE\n\nIt starts off fine, but after a few seconds voices starts to get choppy and then I lose connection. At the end of the clip I hop over to an American instance before I get the error message and do not have any issues there.",
